---
interface Props {
  variant?: "default" | "recruitment";
}

const { variant = "default" } = Astro.props;
---

<section
  class:list={["faq", { "faq--recruitment": variant === "recruitment" }]}
  id="faq"
>
  <h2>Preguntas Frecuentes</h2>

  <div class="faq-content">
    <div class="question">
      <h3>Que es Comando 99?</h3>
      <p>
        Es una comunidad milsim de arma 3, es decir, utilizamos el arma 3 para
        hacer una simulación realista de lo que seria ser parte de las fuerzas
        armadas. Simulación militar
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="question">
      <h3>¿Cómo unirme?</h3>
      <p>
        Únete a nuestro discord, ahí tendrás todas las indicaciones para iniciar
        tu ingreso
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="question">
      <h3>¿Qué tipo de misiones realizan?</h3>
      <p>
        Realizamos misiones tácticas y cooperativas en equipo. Normalmente en el
        siglo XXI aunque en ocasiones hecho misiones especiales en la segunda
        guerra mundial, vietnam etc.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="question">
      <h3>¿Hay requisitos para ingresar?</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Tener Arma 3 original</li>
        <li>Contar con microfono</li>
        <li>Espacio suficiente para instalar mods</li>
        <li>No pertenecer a otro clan</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="question">
      <h3>¿Tienen entrenamientos?</h3>
      <p>
        Sí, ofrecemos entrenamientos de infantería regular, de caballería,
        aérea, cursos de paracaidismo e incluso fuerzas especiales. Tenemos
        actividades todos los dias
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="question">
      <h3>¿Simulan algun pais en particular?</h3>
      <p>
        No nos afiliamos a ningún pais en especial. Simulamos ser una unidad PMC
        (Contratistas privados). Esto nos ofrece mayor versatilidad en todo
        sentido.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .faq {
    box-sizing: border-box;
    width: 100%;
    margin: 0;
    padding-block: 2rem 4rem;
    border-block: 7px double #4b0303;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    background: linear-gradient(
      135deg,
      rgba(30, 12, 12, 0.93),
      rgba(8, 8, 8, 0.94)
    );
    &::before {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      pointer-events: none;
      background-image:
        linear-gradient(rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.027) 1px, transparent 1px),
        linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.027) 1px, transparent 1px);
      background-size: 24px 24px;
    }

    .faq-content,
    h2 {
      width: 90%;
      max-width: 1280px;
      margin: 1rem auto 2rem;
      font-family: "Chakra Petch";
    }
  }
  .question h3 {
    cursor: pointer;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: linear-gradient(120deg, #121212, black, #121212);
    color: white;
    padding: 0.5rem 2rem;
    margin: 0;
    transition: 0.2s;
    font-size: 2rem;
    font-family: "Stick No Bills";
    letter-spacing: 3px;
    border: 2px solid rgba(255, 0, 0, 0.425);
    border-left: 6px solid red;
  }

  .question h2:hover {
    background-color: rgb(44, 44, 44);
  }

  .question {
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: linear-gradient(
      90deg,
      rgba(29, 14, 14, 0.97),
      rgba(18, 10, 10, 0.97)
    );
    padding-top: 0;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .question::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
    opacity: 0.18;
    background-image: url("/images/topographic.png");
    background-repeat: repeat-x;
    background-size: auto 180%;
    background-position: center;
    filter: contrast(1.05) brightness(0.9);
    z-index: 0;
  }

  .question > * {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .question p,
  .question ul {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    max-width: 80ch;
    max-height: 0;
    font-weight: 500;
    opacity: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
    transition:
      max-height 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1),
      opacity 0.35s ease,
      padding 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1),
      margin 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1),
      color 0.3s ease;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0 2.7rem;
    color: transparent;
  }
  .question.open p,
  .question.open ul {
    border-radius: 15px;
    padding: 1.2rem 2.7rem 1.7rem 2rem;
    margin: 1vh 0;
    max-height: 500px;
    opacity: 1;
    color: white;
  }
  .question.open ul {
    padding-left: 4vw;
  }
  .question.open h3 {
    background: #940505;
    border-right: none;

    &::before {
      background-image: none;
    }
  }
  .question.open {
    border: 2px solid rgba(255, 0, 0, 0.425);
    border-top: none;
  }

  .faq--recruitment {
    margin-top: 1.4rem;
    margin-bottom: 0;
    padding: clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 3.2rem);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 95, 80, 0.28);
    background: linear-gradient(
      135deg,
      rgba(30, 12, 12, 0.93),
      rgba(8, 8, 8, 0.94)
    );
    box-shadow: 0 1.5rem 3rem rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.32);
  }

  .faq--recruitment h2,
  .faq--recruitment .faq-content {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: none;
    margin-inline: 0;
  }

  .faq--recruitment h2 {
    margin-top: 0;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    font-family: "Stick No Bills", sans-serif;
    font-size: clamp(2.6rem, 5vw, 4.1rem);
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    line-height: 0.88;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .faq--recruitment .question {
    margin-bottom: 0.65rem;
  }

  .faq--recruitment .question h3 {
    font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2rem);
  }

  .faq--recruitment .question p,
  .faq--recruitment .question ul {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 620px) {
    .faq--recruitment {
      padding: 1.5rem 1.1rem;
    }
  }
</style>
<script>
  const questions = document.querySelectorAll(".question");

  questions.forEach((question) => {
    question.addEventListener("click", () => {
      const isOpen = question.classList.contains("open");
      closeQuestions();
      if (!isOpen) {
        question.classList.add("open");
      }
    });
  });

  function closeQuestions() {
    questions.forEach((q) => q.classList.remove("open"));
  }
</script>
